{"id":"06a154edf19ea063","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-halting-set.md","title":"Halting Set $K$","display":"df-halting-set — Halting Set $K$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-halting-set","aliases":["92-df-halting-set"],"display":"df-halting-set — Halting Set $K$","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursive-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-halting-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-halting-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-halting-set — Halting Set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}\\)</span> (partial-recursive function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (fixed acceptable effective enumeration of the unary partial-recursive functions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}_1,K\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}_1,K\\)</span> (definition-target unary class and diagonal halting set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}halting\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PartRec}\\cap(\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N),\\qquad\n\\{\\varphi_e\\mid e\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\mathrm{PartRec}_1,\\qquad\nK\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid e\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}halting\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PartRec}\\cap(\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N),\\qquad\n\\{\\varphi_e\\mid e\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\mathrm{PartRec}_1,\\qquad\nK\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid e\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> : 停机集（Kleene集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in K\">\\(n \\in K\\)</span> iff 程序<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>在输入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>上停机</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>是r.e.集（可枚举：模拟所有程序）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>不可判定（停机问题不可解）</li>\n<li>可接受编号所满足的参数化性质保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 是多一完全的（所有 c.e. 集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m K\">\\(\\leq_m K\\)</span>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>是创造集</li>\n<li>对满足合适有效性、算术表达能力和一致性条件的理论，其可证句码集与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 之间可建立相应归约；不能对任意所谓“Gödel 集”无条件断言双向多一归约</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","s